   _Assembly.Details
;
K33-linked diubiquitin, in which two ubiquitin molecules are linked via 
an isopeptide bond between the carboxyl group of Gly76 of the distal 
ubiquitin and the epsilon-amine of Lys33 of the proximal ubiquitin. 
The diubiquitin was made from recombinant ubiquitins using non-enzymatic 
assembly of natural polyubiquitin chains.
;
